{
  "1": {
    "episodeId": 1,
    "title": "The New Queen",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007803",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Once upon a time, there was a young princess.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Her name was Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "She had white skin, red cheeks, and black hair.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Snow White's mother died long ago.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "So Snow White lived alone with her father.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "They were very happy together.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Then one day the king fell in love.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Soon the kingdom had a new queen.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "And Snow White had a new mother.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Snow White tried to play with her new stepmother.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Go away!\" The queen slammed her bedroom door.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Alone, the queen looked into her magic mirror.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "\"Mirror, mirror on the wall,\" she asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Who is the fairest of them all?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"My Lady,\" the mirror said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"You are the fairest woman in the kingdom.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Years passed, and Snow White grew up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "She often walked through the village.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "She sang songs with children.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "She gave food to poor people.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Everyone loved the young princess.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"Snow White is so beautiful,\" a woman said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"I wish I could marry her,\" a man said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "But the queen didn't like Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "She never spent time with the girl.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Instead she talked to her mirror.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"Mirror! I'm the most beautiful woman, right?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"My Lady,\" the mirror said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"You are indeed quite fair.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "But now there's someone more beautiful.\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "2": {
    "episodeId": 2,
    "title": "The Hunter",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007804",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "\"What?\" the queen shouted at her mirror.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"Who is more beautiful than I am?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"Snow White, My Lady,\" the mirror said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "The queen was very angry.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"Everyone says Snow White is so pretty!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "She's so nice, so perfect!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Well, they will stop saying it soon!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "That night the queen met a hunter in the village.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "He carried an ax.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "The queen whispered in his ear.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Then she slipped some gold coins into his hand.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "The next day Snow White walked through the village.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "A stranger grabbed her.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Let me go!\" Snow White cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "It was the hunter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "He threw Snow White onto a horse.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"Ya!\" he cried as he jumped on.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "The horse reached a dark forest.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Snow White saw black, tangled branches.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Then something else caught her eye.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "An ax hung from the hunter's belt.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Snow White gulped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"Please, sir! Let me go!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "I haven't done anything wrong!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Tears slipped down her cheeks.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "The hunter sighed and stopped the horse.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"You poor child,\" he said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"Go. But don't ever return home.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "The queen wants you dead!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Snow White gasped. \"Why?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"It doesn't matter,\" the hunter said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"Just go!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "Snow White disappeared among the trees.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "\"Poor Snow White,\" the hunter thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"She will never survive in this forest.\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "3": {
    "episodeId": 3,
    "title": "The Dark Forest",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007805",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Snow White ran deep into the forest.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Branches pulled her hair.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Thorns scratched her arms and hands.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Snow White climbed over rocks and tree roots.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "At last she stopped to rest.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"How big is this forest?\" Snow White said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"I've walked for hours.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Now I'm lost, and it's getting late.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Dark shadows stretched across the forest floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "A chilly wind shook tree branches.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Dead leaves blew through the air.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"I must find shelter,\" Snow White said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "She looked around.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"But where?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Snap!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Snow White held her breath.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "She stared into the darkness.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Was the hunter coming back for her?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Snow White ran.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Branches hit her face.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Her foot caught a tree root.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Snow White tumbled down a hill.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "When she sat up, she saw a pair of eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"A wolf!\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Growling, the wolf stepped closer.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "The wolf looked deep into Snow White's eyes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Suddenly the wolf's face changed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "The wolf wagged its tail and then ran off.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"That was strange,\" Snow White thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "As Snow White stood up, she saw something.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "A faint light twinkled through the trees.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Snow White gasped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"I see a house!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "4": {
    "episodeId": 4,
    "title": "Seven of Everything",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007806",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Snow White hurried to the house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "She was shivering with cold.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "A stack of firewood sat by the door.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "In the window a candle burned brightly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Snow White bent low to knock on a tiny door.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Hello! Is anyone home?\" she called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Snow White pushed the door open.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "A fire crackled in a fireplace.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "The room felt warm and cozy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "There was a long, low table.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Hmm,\" Snow White thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Seven plates of food.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Seven forks, seven spoons, and seven mugs.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Snow White scratched her head.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"There's seven of everything.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "And it's all so small!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Seeing the food made Snow White hungry.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "She ate from a plate.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "She drank from a mug.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Then she moved to the next plate and mug.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Snow White made her way around the entire table.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Then she yawned. \"I'm so tired.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "In another room Snow White found seven small beds.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"I could sleep forever,\" she mumbled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "She lay down on one of the beds.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"Oh, too lumpy!\" Snow White said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "The second bed was too firm.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "She made her way through all the beds.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Finally Snow White found the perfect bed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "She snuggled under the blankets.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Then she drifted off to sleep.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "5": {
    "episodeId": 5,
    "title": "Seven Dwarfs",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007807",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Seven dwarfs stomped into the house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Picks and bags fell to the floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"Whew!\" one dwarf said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Working in the mines is hard work.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "I'm starving!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Me too,\" the second dwarf said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "The third dwarf nodded. \"And me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "The dwarfs sat down at the table.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Um . . .\" The fourth dwarf stared at his plate.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"Where's my dinner?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "The other dwarfs looked at their plates.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "There were seven gasps.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "The fifth dwarf jumped out of his chair.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Somebody robbed us!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "The seven dwarfs looked under furniture.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "They peeked inside the cupboard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"I don't see anyone,\" the sixth dwarf said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"And nothing else is missing.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Next the dwarfs searched their dark bedroom.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"Ouch! Who stepped on my foot?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"Sorry, I—oof!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"Pardon me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"Shh!\" the seventh dwarf said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"Someone is sleeping in my bed!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "He held out a candle.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "The six other dwarfs hurried over.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "They peered at Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"She's beautiful,\" one said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"Should we wake her?\" another asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "The first dwarf shook his head. \"Let her sleep.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "The seventh dwarf looked around.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"But I don't have a bed.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "The first dwarf shrugged.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "\"We have six other beds.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "You can sleep in each one for an hour.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "\"Okay,\" the seventh dwarf mumbled.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "6": {
    "episodeId": 6,
    "title": "New Friends",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007808",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The next morning Snow White woke up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Seven faces stared at her.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"Oh, my!\" She sat up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"We won't hurt you!\" the first dwarf said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"What's your name?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Snow White,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"My name is Dar,\" the dwarf said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "He introduced the other dwarfs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"This is Mar, Par, Gar, Zar, Yar, and Star!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "All the dwarfs stared at Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Where are you from?\" Mar asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Do you have a family?\" Par asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Snow White told the dwarfs her story.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Gar bit his lip. \"I never liked the new queen!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Zar nodded. \"She's awful!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"The worst,\" Yar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "A tear fell from Star's eye.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"That's the saddest story ever!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Snow White, please stay here with us.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Snow White smiled. \"That sounds wonderful!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"We have to be careful,\" Dar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"The queen must not learn that you're alive!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "The dwarfs got ready for work.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"We'll be back after dark,\" Dar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Don't let anyone in!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"Okay,\" Snow White promised.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Snow White spent the day cleaning the house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "By sunset, soup was cooking on the stove.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Snow White smiled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"My new friends will be home soon!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Meanwhile the queen was standing in front of her mirror.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "She laughed loudly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"Now I'm the most beautiful woman in the kingdom.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "Right, Mirror?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"No, My Lady,\" the mirror said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "\"There is someone a thousand times more beautiful.\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "7": {
    "episodeId": 7,
    "title": "The Coat",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007809",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "\"My Lady,\" the mirror said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"Snow White is the most beautiful woman in the kingdom.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "The queen gritted her teeth.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Oh no! She's still alive!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "The next morning the dwarfs left for the mines.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Dar waved good-bye to Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Remember,\" he called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"Don't let anyone in!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Snow White was washing dishes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"Clothes for sale!\" a voice called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Lovely, beautiful clothes!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Snow White went to the window.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "An old woman was walking by.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "She pulled a small wagon loaded with chests.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"Hello, miss!\" the woman said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Would you like to buy something?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Snow White remembered Dar's warning.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"No, thank you,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "The woman pulled a fancy coat out of a chest.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "She stepped toward the house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"This coat matches your hair,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Snow White gazed at the beautiful coat.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "The woman stepped closer.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"Just try it on,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"There's no harm in that.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Snow White bit her lip. \"Well . . . Okay.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "The woman smiled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "She held up the coat for Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Snow White put one arm through.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "She put her other arm through.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Suddenly the coat grew tight.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "It squeezed her entire body.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"Ahh!\" Snow White cried. \"I can't breathe!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "The woman laughed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"Good-bye, Snow White!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "Then— poof! The woman vanished.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "8": {
    "episodeId": 8,
    "title": "A Dark House",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007810",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The dwarfs stepped out of the mine.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Dar wiped his forehead. \"Whew!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Mar rubbed his belly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"I hope Snow White made a hot dinner.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"Snow White is wonderful,\" Par said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Why was the queen so nasty to her?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "I don't understand.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Gar bit his lip. \"I never liked the new queen.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Zar nodded. \"She's awful.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"The worst,\" Yar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "A tear fell from Star's eye.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Dar patted Star on the shoulder.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "\"Don't worry, Star.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Snow White is safe with us.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "The dwarfs sang as they walked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "But when they got home, the house was dark.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"There's no fire,\" Dar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Mar sniffed. \"I don't smell dinner.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Uh-oh!\" The dwarfs rushed into the house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "They gasped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Snow White lay on the floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"She's not breathing!\" Par said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"Get that coat off of her!\" Gar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Zar and Yar ripped off the coat's buttons.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Star yanked at the sleeves.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Snow White was free!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "She opened her eyes. \"Oh!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "I'm so happy to see you all!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"What happened?\" Dar asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Snow White told them about the old woman.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"It must have been the queen!\" Dar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Meanwhile the queen stood before her mirror.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"My Lady,\" the mirror said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "\"Snow White is still alive—and still beautiful.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "The queen screamed.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "9": {
    "episodeId": 9,
    "title": "The Comb",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007811",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "\"Remember, Snow White,\" Dar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"Don't let anyone in!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"I won't,\" Snow White said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Snow White swept.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Then she sat down with a book.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Knock, knock!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Snow White jumped up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"Who is it?\" Snow White asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Just an old woman,\" the person said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Snow White peeked outside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "She saw a woman with a long nose.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Hmm,\" Snow White thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "\"She's not the woman from yesterday.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Please buy a comb,\" the woman said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"I need money for food.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Oh, you're hungry?\" Snow White felt sad.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"Come in,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "The woman handed a comb to Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"It's lovely!\" Snow White said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Snow White ran the comb through her hair.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"Ahh!\" She fell to the floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "The woman laughed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"Good-bye, Snow White!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "The dwarfs arrived home.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Snow White lay on the floor very still.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"Oh no!\" Dar cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "The dwarfs tried to wake her up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"Is she dead?\" Mar asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Star wiped a tear from his eye.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"What's this?\" Par asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "He pulled a comb from Snow White's hair.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "The princess woke up!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"That comb must be poisoned,\" Dar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "Zar made a fist. \"The queen did this.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "Yar made a fist. \"She's the worst!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "At the castle a servant passed the queen's room.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p37",
        "text": "From inside he heard a terrible shout.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "10": {
    "episodeId": 10,
    "title": "The Apple",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007812",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The queen stomped her foot.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "She threw her hairbrush and screamed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"I hate Snow White!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "The queen took a deep breath. \"I need a plan.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "She paced back and forth across the room.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Then she stopped. \"I know!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "I will create a poison apple!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Snow White sat by her window.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Apples for sale!\" a woman shouted.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"Wonderful, delicious apples!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"That must be the queen again,\" Snow White thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Hello, dear!\" The woman approached Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "\"Do you want to buy an apple?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Snow White frowned.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"No, thank you,\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Are you sure?\" The woman held up an apple.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"This one looks delicious.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "She held the apple closer to Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Snow White's eyes went wide.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"What a beautiful apple,\" she thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "It was bright red.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Light seemed to sparkle around it.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"I must not trust this woman,\" Snow White thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "But the apple looked so . . . delicious.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "The woman smiled. \"Try it, dear.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Snow White gazed at the apple.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"Just . . . one bite,\" she murmured.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Snow White's teeth sank deep into the apple.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Everything went dark.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"Mirror!\" the queen snapped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "\"Who is the most beautiful woman in the land?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"My Lady.\" The mirror sounded sad.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"You are.\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "11": {
    "episodeId": 11,
    "title": "The Glass Coffin",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007813",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "That night the dwarfs arrived home late.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Once again the house was dark.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Snow White lay on the floor without moving.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Oh no!\" Dar cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "The dwarfs shook Snow White.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "They shouted her name.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "But she didn't wake up.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Dar gulped. \"Snow White is . . . dead.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "When the sun rose, the seven dwarfs were still crying.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "The dwarfs built a glass coffin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "They made a bed of flowers inside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Gently they laid Snow White in the coffin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "They set the coffin outside among the trees.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "The sun shined down on her.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Inside her coffin Snow White was still beautiful.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"It's strange,\" Zar said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"She doesn't look quite dead.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Yar nodded. \"It looks like she's sleeping.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "Star wiped a tear from his eye.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Animals gathered around the coffin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Everyone in the forest was very sad.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Birds sang sweet songs.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "One day a prince was traveling through the forest.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "He hummed softly as he rode along.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "The prince passed a small house.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "He saw a dwarf resting on a glass coffin.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"How odd.\" The prince got down from his horse.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "He walked toward the dwarf.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "\"Hello!\" the prince called.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "The dwarf woke with a start. \"Ahh!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "He banged into the coffin . . .",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "And it fell to the ground!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "12": {
    "episodeId": 12,
    "title": "A Wedding",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0007814",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "The prince rushed toward Star. \"Are you okay?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "\"Yes,\" Star said. \"But—\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Someone gasped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Snow White! She's breathing!\" Star shouted.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "The prince looked down.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Inside the coffin was a beautiful girl.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "The prince threw open the coffin's lid.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "He helped Snow White to her feet.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "\"Thank you, sir,\" Snow White said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "The prince couldn't stop staring at her.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "The other dwarfs rushed over.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Hooray!\" Dar cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Gar picked up a piece of apple.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"Be careful!\" Snow White cried.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"That apple is poisoned.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "It was stuck in my throat.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Something knocked it out.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Star blushed. \"I knocked the coffin over.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "It was an accident.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Snow White hugged him.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"You saved my life, Star!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "The prince was already in love with the young woman.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"What happened to you?\" he asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Snow White told him about the queen.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "The prince dropped to one knee.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"That evil woman cannot hurt you now,\" he said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "\"Please . . . Marry me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "The whole kingdom was invited to the wedding.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "When the queen arrived, she looked around.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"Who is the bride?\" she said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Then she saw her. \"No! Not Snow White!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "The queen stomped out of the wedding.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "Soon she moved to a faraway kingdom.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "But Snow White and the prince stayed right there.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "And lived happily ever after.",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}
